WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.547
[Tracks rumble underneath a burst of gunfire]

00:02.567 --> 00:05.047
[Helicopter rotors beat as the aircraft lifts]

00:05.067 --> 00:08.647
[Running footsteps and a sudden blast]

00:08.667 --> 00:12.613
[Rifles fire in short bursts]

00:12.633 --> 00:15.947
[Tank engine, gunfire and a heavy impact]

00:15.967 --> 00:19.747
[An aircraft passes and impacts roll across the yard]

00:19.767 --> 00:24.613
[A line of blasts echoes across the intersection]
